Bonebreak is a devastating monk technique that uses leverage and precise
force application to fracture an opponent's limbs. Unlike brute-force
attacks, this skill relies on understanding anatomy and exploiting the
natural weaknesses of skeletal structure.

Usage: bonebreak <target>

When successful, Bonebreak can inflict serious damage and potentially
break one of the victim's limbs, causing lasting combat penalties until
healed. Some creatures with unusual physiology or supernatural resilience
may be immune to bone-breaking effects.

This skill embodies the monk philosophy that technique and knowledge
triumph over raw strength. A well-placed bonebreak can disable even
the mightiest foe.

Class: Monk
Discipline: Leverage

